{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217770","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217770","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1321777001:0":{"text":"リアさん、姫様はどちらにおられるのです？","source_cn":"莉娅女士，公主殿下在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E68B8D24FE6B713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321777002:0":{"text":"またおかしくなってしまわれたのですか、ロドリゴ様？","source_cn":"你的神志又不清醒了，罗德里戈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DFF542A0C59F40D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321777003:0":{"text":"今しがた、姫様がデューラ様にセレストレアを捧げたではありませんか。なぜ姫様にご挨拶をされないのです？","source_cn":"为什么不向公主殿下行礼？她刚刚向艾雅献上了蓝绒花！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF44BE9A3E6F126BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321777004:0":{"text":"ロ、ロンロンが幻覚を見ているのでしょうか……リアさんのそばに誰かいるんですか？","source_cn":"是、是满满出现幻觉了吗……莉娅女士身边有人吗……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFD8D855518290932","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ロ、ロンロンが幻覚を見ているのでしょうか……リアさんのそばに誰かいるんですか？","female":"ロ、ロンロンが幻覚を見ているのでしょうか……リアさんのそばに誰かいるんですか？","variant_male_record_index":"152367","variant_female_record_index":"152368","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1321777004":{"text":"ロ、ロンロンが幻覚を見ているのでしょうか……リアさんのそばに誰かいるんですか？","source_cn":"是、是满满出现幻觉了吗……莉娅女士身边有人吗……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFD8D855518290932","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ロ、ロンロンが幻覚を見ているのでしょうか……リアさんのそばに誰かいるんですか？","female":"ロ、ロンロンが幻覚を見ているのでしょうか……リアさんのそばに誰かいるんですか？","variant_male_record_index":"152367","variant_female_record_index":"152368","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321777005:0":{"text":"……リア殿。自分が何を言っているのか分かっているのか？","source_cn":"……莉娅女士，你知道自己在说什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0421E4CDF03B57A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321777006:0":{"text":"聖騎士様……デューラ様は姫様を守っていらっしゃるのですよね？そうですよね？","source_cn":"圣骑士大人……艾雅正在庇佑公主殿下，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C7E2922307EEAE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321777007:0":{"text":"見てください！デューラ様のご加護のおかげで、姫様の顔色がこんなに良くなったんですよ！","source_cn":"看，蒙艾雅垂怜，公主殿下的气色已经恢复了这么多！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6BD4605DF020AE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321777008:0":{"text":"……もう十分です。","source_cn":"……够了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14C3BD59D34666AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321777009:1":{"text":"しっかりしてください、リアさん。","source_cn":"快点清醒过来，莉娅女士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9D88D1B2A8423B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321777010:0":{"text":"何を言っているのです？私はいつだってしっかりしていますよ！","source_cn":"你在说什么？我一直很清醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04B2745BABC313A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321777011:0":{"text":"姫様が病に苦しんでいた時だって、私がしっかりしていなかったら、姫様は――","source_cn":"之前公主殿下病得那么厉害，要是我再不清醒一点的话，殿下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9DDF15C6107F6B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321777012:1":{"text":"――姫様はもう亡くなられたのです！","source_cn":"——公主殿下已经去世了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B7F02D19427E581","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321777013:1":{"text":"目を開けて、よく見てください！姫様はそこにはいません！あなたの隣にあるのは、冷え切った、何もない空間だけです！","source_cn":"睁开眼睛，看清楚！公主殿下根本不在你身边！你身边只有一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF79D28C7FF0B8E1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321777014:1":{"text":"本物の姫様はもう、この世にはいないのですよ！","source_cn":"真正的公主殿下，早就已经去世了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC123FF3B23264A29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321777015:0":{"text":"ロドリゴ様……あ、あなた……よくも姫様にそんな恐ろしいことを！","source_cn":"罗德里戈……你……你竟敢诅咒公主殿下？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x502A20F8F5C8771B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321777016:0":{"text":"姫様は亡くなってなどいません……亡くなるはずがありません！私とお医者様が必死に看病をしているのに、国中の人たちが祈っているのに、亡くなるなんてあり得ない！","source_cn":"殿下没死……殿下怎么可能死？！在我和医生的悉心呵护下，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDF214872547E05C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"いや、誰もいないよ。","source_cn":"这里没有别人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCBF3499CE3613B37","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"いや、誰もいないよ。","female":"いいえ、誰もいないわ。","variant_male_record_index":"268427","variant_female_record_index":"268429","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"幻覚を見ているのは君じゃない。","source_cn":"出现幻觉的不是你","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF0353251698A3210","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"幻覚を見ているのは君じゃない。","female":"幻覚を見ているのはあなたじゃない。","variant_male_record_index":"70176","variant_female_record_index":"70177","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:2:3":{"text":"問題は彼女の方にある。","source_cn":"有问题的是莉娅女士","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x06C898E9FEDEA7CC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"問題は彼女の方にある。","femal